    "body": "Follow-up to #657. HuggingFaceGpt2Oracle::attention_operator_spec is deliberately None: the only registered operator standard-source-attention/1 declares positional_action=rope-rotation-of-q-and-k-before-scoring, which GPT-2 does NOT do (learned absolute positions). Register a new versioned operator (learned-absolute positional action) in attention.rs (registry still refusing unknown (id,version)) and wire attention_operator_spec to it; feeds the #606 certificate operator row. See #657. Filed unassigned per board rules.",
